note: a belief previously repudiated (or held as a wart/gap) turns out
  to have been a stale pin on a shipped mechanism — the machinery was
  green, the evidence was rotten. df72d80eb: event globbing was
  "never green" only because its tests predated the SiteResult ABI;
  the resolver/matcher had shipped whole. Distinct from a real
  repudiation: nothing about the design was wrong — the *record* was.
